[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:Jegvar]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:02.00] 制作人 : Roger Waters/David Gilmour/Bob Ezrin
[00:29.48]I got a little black book with my poems in.
[00:29.48]我有一本黑色诗集，上面写我的诗
[00:34.14]Got a bag, got a toothbrush and a comb.
[00:34.14]我有一个包、一根牙刷和一支梳子
[00:39.70]When I'm a good dog they sometimes throw me a bone.
[00:39.70]如果我很听话，人们有时会给我点“赏赐”
[00:47.64]I got elastic bands keeping my shoes on.
[00:47.64]我的鞋带系牢了我的鞋子
[00:52.36]Got those swollen hands blues.
[00:52.36]我肿胀的双手让我心情低落
[00:57.49]Got thirteen channels of shit on the TV to choose from.
[00:57.49]我只能在13个无趣的电视频道间来回跳转
[01:04.86]I got electric light,
[01:04.86]我有一盏电灯
[01:08.16]And I got second sight.
[01:08.16]我有超人的预见力
[01:14.88]Got amazing powers of observation.
[01:14.88]和惊人的观察力
[01:25.55]And that is how I know,
[01:25.55]这就是我为什么知道
[01:28.81]When I try to get through,
[01:28.81]当我试着联系你
[01:33.00]On the telephone to you,
[01:33.00]通过电话联系你时
[01:39.35]There'll be nobody home.
[01:39.35]将不会得到回应
[01:45.74]I got the obligatory Hendrix perm,
[01:45.74]我一直留着Hendrix的发型
[01:55.95]And the inevitable pinhole burns,
[01:55.95]那些不可避免的针型烫孔
[02:01.40]All down the front of my favorite satin shirt,
[02:01.40]也还都一直留在我最喜欢的那件缎子衬衣上
[02:07.54]I got nicotine stains on my fingers.
[02:07.54]我的手指上还残留着烟渍
[02:14.28]I got a silver spoon on a chain.
[02:14.28]我挂着一条银匙项链
[02:17.86]Got a grand piano to prop my mortal remains.
[02:17.86]那架大钢琴支撑着我毫无生气的躯体
[02:26.07]I've got wild, staring eyes.
[02:26.07]我瞪大了我呆滞无神的眼睛
[02:32.35]And I got a strong urge to fly.
[02:32.35]我有强烈地想要飞翔的冲动
[02:37.01]But I got nowhere to fly to… fly to… fly to… fly to.
[02:37.01]但我却哪里也飞不到
[02:50.67]Ooooo Babe,
[02:50.67]哦，宝贝
[02:57.02]When I pick up the phone,
[02:57.02]当我再次拿起电话时
[03:03.65]There's still nobody home.
[03:03.65]依旧没有没人接听
[03:08.54]I got a pair of Gohill boots,
[03:08.54]我穿着一双Gohill的靴子
[03:17.81]And I got fading roots.
[03:17.81]却找不到立身之所
